# Act One

## Scene 1

A bus shelter at dusk. One bench. Rain drums on the roof.

JUNE sits at one end with a closed umbrella across her knees. ARLO enters, soaked.

ARLO
Is this seat taken?

JUNE
(without looking up)
Only by the rain.

He sits. A long pause. She opens the umbrella over both of them.

## Scene 2

The same shelter, the next morning. The bench is dry.

ARLO
Same time tomorrow?

JUNE
Bring your *own* umbrella.

Blackout.

